==English==

===Etymology===
First attested [[w:1382|1382]], from {{etyl|fro}} {{term|cocatris|lang=fro}}, from {{LL.}} {{term|calcatrix|calcātrīx|she who treads upon something|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|la}} {{term|calco|calcō|tread|lang=la}}, from {{term|calx|calx|heel, hoof|lang=la}}.

